OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding victims 'suffering
OL,4,Asleepless nights'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in certain areas of
OL,7,FBirmingham are "suffering sleepless
OL,8,Fnights" amid flooding fears, a
OL,9,Fcouncillor has said.
OL,11,FLabour group leader Nicky Brennan made
OL,12,Fthe remarks just days after a storm
OL,13,Fflooded homes and left roads submerged
OL,14,Fin the north of the city.
OL,16,FDozens of homes were hit by flooding at
OL,17,Fthe end of last month with the city
OL,18,Fcouncil saying water levels reached up
OL,19,Fto one metre in the worst-affected
OL,20,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
